message: >-
  This repository contains two companion papers. If you use the
  mathematical results of either, please cite its own permanent Zenodo
  archive, not this GitHub repository: the Classes I/II paper is given
  below as preferred-citation, and the Class III paper is listed under
  references. See README.md ("Companion Papers" / "How to Cite") for
  the full citation guidance for each paper individually. This
  repository is a code and reproducibility archive for both manuscripts.
title: >-
